<title>GERMANY: Pan-German prel 1996 GDP grows 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Pan-German prel 1996 GDP grows 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, GERMANY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office gave the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>    PAN-GERMAN GDP		    1996	 1995</p>
<p>    GDP change			  +1.4	 +1.9</p>
<p>    Private consumption	     +1.4	 +1.8</p>
<p>    Public consumption		+2.8	 +2.0</p>
<p>    Capital investment		+2.6	 +2.0</p>
<p>    Building investment	     -2.7	 +1.2</p>
<p>    Exports			     +4.6	 +5.9</p>
<p>    Imports			     +2.0	 +6.4</p>
<p>NOTE: figures are seasonally adjusted and based on 1991 prices. -- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
